{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10644010","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10644010","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1064401001:0":{"text":"アルナ将軍だ！帰ってきた！ ","source_cn":"是阿尔娜将军，她回来啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F52E83E664544F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1064401002:0":{"text":"神のご加護があらんことを。アルナ様のおかげで、北方の狼も盗賊も<style=\"highlight\">サバス城</style>には近づけません。今年の冬も、安心して眠ることができます。","source_cn":"诸神保佑，多亏了阿尔娜，北地的狼群和匪患才不敢靠近<s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B677F4DAB6C4ADE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1064401003:0":{"text":"アルナ将軍！わたしもいつか、将軍みたいに大きな馬に乗って、長い槍を持って、みんなを守りたい！","source_cn":"阿尔娜将军！我以后也要像您一样，骑着大马，拿着长枪，保...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA86406BA81FB0371","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1064401004:0":{"text":"少女が嬉しそうにアルナのもとへ駆けていくと、後ろにいた母親が慌てて引き止め、申し訳なさそうに頭を下げた。","source_cn":"孩童兴奋地冲到阿尔娜身前，身后的母亲急忙拉住她，对阿尔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B211142D7E94355","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1064401005:1":{"text":"小さき者よ。武器を握る前に、まずは母親の手をしっかり握るのだ。","source_cn":"小家伙，握紧武器之前，先学会抓牢母亲的手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DCE5B3ED3AA1A9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064401006:1":{"text":"そして強くなれ。サバス城は、そなたの力も必要としている。","source_cn":"然后努力变强，安息城需要每一份力量。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB1CEA29EBAF3ED4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1064401007:0":{"text":"アルナは歓迎する人々の間を馬で駆け抜け、一度も足を止めることなく城へ入った。そこへ、一人の高官が出迎える。","source_cn":"阿尔娜驱马穿过欢迎她的人群，未曾停留。入城后，一位高官迎来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C576B8EE0ABE2A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1064401008:0":{"text":"将軍様、ご凱旋をお喜び申し上げます。北方の吹雪も、将軍様の御前では道を譲ったようですな。","source_cn":"祝贺将军凯旋，看来北地的风雪，又一次为您让出了道路。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA526CC175459F05C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1064401009:0":{"text":"領主様も直々お迎えに上がる予定でしたが、ここ数日の政務による疲労が重なり、ただ今ご休息中にございます。代わりに褒賞を預かっておりますので、どうかお受け取りを……","source_cn":"领主大人本想亲自迎接，只是近日为城邦事务辛劳过度，此刻...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF919B4F8E61C4FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1064401010:0":{"text":"ダン、すべて記録だ。\n戦功に応じて兵士へ分配、とりわけ戦没者の遺族を手厚く遇せよ。","source_cn":"邓恩，全部登记。\\n按军功分给出征士兵，尤其是阵亡者的遗属。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B433E0B4E2C49B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1064401011:0":{"text":"はい、将軍様！","source_cn":"是，将军！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDDFFF4DFA7B47F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1064401012:0":{"text":"そ……そちらは将軍様のためにご用意した褒賞であって……分配は領主様への礼に反するかと……","source_cn":"这……将军，这是领主大人对您一人的赏赐，于礼不合。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E83AD0E8DC7C14F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1064401013:0":{"text":"これは慣例だ。\nまだ軍の巡察が残ってるでな。我はこれにて失礼する。","source_cn":"这是惯例。\\n军队有待巡视，不奉陪了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x494DCEC6562EE886","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1064401014:0":{"text":"職務に忠実であられること、何ら異論はございません。ですが、長旅でお疲れのことでしょう。すでに晩餐の席を整えておりますゆえ、領主様がお目覚めに……","source_cn":"将军忠于职守，无可指摘。只是鞍马劳顿，我已备下晚宴，待...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1B2BF1E23937694","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1064401015:1":{"text":"退け。","source_cn":"让开。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F33CD4B87DD7728","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1064401016:0":{"text":"夕暮れ時、サバス城の東門に二人の兵士が立っていた。そのうちの一人が寒さで赤くなった両手をこすり合わせ、持ち場を離れようとする……","source_cn":"傍晚时分，安息城东门，两名执勤士兵挺立，其中一人搓了搓...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CA43881B36C0C4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1064401017:0":{"text":"ライメル、城門には二人立つと軍規で決まってる。交代が来る前に離れることは許されないぞ。","source_cn":"莱默尔，换岗的人还没来，按军规，不能随便离开城门。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87B434B96A22E52D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1064401018:1":{"text":"いや……でも時間だろ？営舎へ呼びに行こうと思っただけだよ。それにこの寒さだ。俺が離れてる間に都合よく敵なんて……","source_cn":"呃……我就是打算去营里催一声，大冷天的，敌人不会碰巧在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E0E53BD4210B014","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1064401019:0":{"text":"誰かーー！あっ、城の方々！どうか、わしらを中へ入れてくだされ！","source_cn":"大人——城里的大人们！行行好，放我们进城吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAAF39A64C91A6812","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1064401020:0":{"text":"誰だ！？火の明かりへ寄れ、人数を確認する！病を患っている者はいないな！？","source_cn":"谁？！站到火光里来，让我看清人数！有没有人身患疾病？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21FBF95063E4B5B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_tit